{"additionalPlain":"Why Join Welo Data?  \n✨ Limitless Flexibility  \nProject-based opportunities that fit your availability. Choose when and how much you want to contribute—fully remote, with complete autonomy.   \n🌱 Limitless Growth  \nOptional access to AI and Large Language Model workshops designed specifically for professionals like you. No coding required—just your expertise.   \n🌍 Limitless Support  \nBe part of a global contributor community with responsive guidance and support.   \n💡 Real Impact  \nApply your expertise in the Legal field to influence the AI systems shaping the future of your industry—while collaborating with data professionals and expanding your skills.  \n \nHow to Apply? \nApply now by answering a few quick questions to join our database and become part of our growing community. \n \nAbout Welo Data \nWelo Data, part of Welocalize, is a global AI data company with 500,000+ contributors delivering high-quality, ethical data to train the world’s most advanced AI systems. We’re building smarter, more human AI with a diverse community in 100+ countries.  \nAt Welo Data, Limitless AI. Limitless You. isn’t just a slogan—it’s our promise. We build smarter AI through the power of human contribution, offering limitless opportunities for our global community to grow, contribute, and work on their terms. \n","additional":"<div>\n<div><strong>Why Join Welo Data?&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>✨ Limitless Flexibility &nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div>Project-based opportunities that fit your availability. Choose when and how much you want to contribute—fully remote, with complete autonomy. &nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>🌱<strong> Limitless Growth &nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div>Optional access to AI and Large Language Model workshops designed specifically for professionals like you. No coding required—just your expertise. &nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>🌍<strong> Limitless Support &nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div>Be part of a global contributor community with responsive guidance and support. &nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>💡<strong> Real Impact &nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div>Apply your expertise in the Legal field to influence the AI systems shaping the future of your industry—while collaborating with data professionals and expanding your skills.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>How to Apply?&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div>Apply now by answering a few quick questions to join our database and become part of our growing community.&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>About Welo Data&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div>Welo Data, part of Welocalize, is a global AI data company with 500,000+ contributors delivering high-quality, ethical data to train the world’s most advanced AI systems. We’re building smarter, more human AI with a diverse community in 100+ countries.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>At Welo Data, Limitless AI. Limitless You. isn’t just a slogan—it’s our promise. We build smarter AI through the power of human contribution, offering limitless opportunities for our global community to grow, contribute, and work on their terms.&nbsp;</div>\n</div>","categories":{"commitment":"Freelance","department":"Welo Data - AI Services","location":"Philippines","team":"AI Service General Application","allLocations":["Philippines"]},"createdAt":1787294686074,"descriptionPlain":"About the Role \nWe are looking for detail-oriented annotators to help label robot manipulation videos for AI training purposes. You'll watch short videos of robots performing manipulation tasks (filmed from three synchronized camera angles) and produce precise, structured, natural-language descriptions of the actions taking place. This work directly supports the development of robotics AI models and requires strong written English, sharp observational skills, and the discipline to follow a detailed style guide consistently. \nWhat You'll Do \nWatch short robot manipulation videos, each filmed from three synchronized camera views (an overhead view and views from each of the robot's two wrist-mounted cameras). \n\n\n","description":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">About the Role</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We are looking for detail-oriented annotators to help label robot manipulation videos for AI training purposes.&nbsp;You'll&nbsp;watch short videos of robots performing manipulation tasks (filmed from three synchronized camera angles) and produce precise, structured, natural-language descriptions of the actions taking place. This work directly supports the development of robotics AI models and requires strong written English, sharp observational skills, and the discipline to follow a detailed style guide consistently.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What You'll Do</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Watch short robot manipulation videos, each filmed from three synchronized camera views (an overhead view and views from each of the robot's two wrist-mounted cameras).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Break each video into time segments and write clear, natural-language descriptions for each segment.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Apply labels at three levels of detail for each applicable segment:&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"o\" data-font=\"Courier New\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"2\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Atomic motion</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;(a few seconds) — a single small movement (e.g., \"close fingers around the red handle\")</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"o\" data-font=\"Courier New\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"2\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Skill / subtask</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;(several seconds to ~20&nbsp;seconds) —&nbsp;a complete, meaningful action (e.g., \"pick up the red block by its edge\")</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"o\" data-font=\"Courier New\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"2\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Task / goal</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;(up to ~1&nbsp;minute) —&nbsp;the overall purpose of a sequence of skills (e.g., \"place all blocks in the container\")</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ensure every moment of video is covered by a label at two or more of these levels — no gaps, including idle or pause moments.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Accurately describe&nbsp;exactly what happens, including when something&nbsp;doesn't&nbsp;go as planned (a dropped object, a failed grasp, a slipped grip). Precision matters more than making the robot look successful.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Cross-reference&nbsp;all three camera angles: use the overhead view to understand the overall scene and object identity, and the close-up wrist views to confirm exact contact and grasp details.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Follow a detailed style guide covering vocabulary for actions, spatial relationships, object descriptions, and manner of movement, applying it consistently across many episodes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Participate in periodic calibration sessions to align your labeling with the team and the client's reference examples.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What We're Looking For</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Required:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong written English —&nbsp;you'll&nbsp;write dozens of short, precise descriptive sentences per video and need to vary your language rather than repeating the same phrases.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Sharp attention to detail — able to distinguish&nbsp;small differences&nbsp;(a successful grasp vs. a fumble, a push vs. a drag, which specific object part is being touched).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Comfort following a detailed, structured style guide and applying it consistently, even in ambiguous or edge-case scenarios.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Basic comfort with spatial/mechanical description (left/right, above/below, naming object parts like handles, lids, or edges).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Reliable, self-directed work&nbsp;habits — this is&nbsp;often heads-down work with periodic check-ins rather than close supervision.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Nice to Have:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Prior experience with video annotation, data labeling, transcription, or QA work.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Familiarity with robotics terminology (grippers, end-effectors, manipulation) — helpful but not necessary, as the style guide is self-contained.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience with annotation tools such as Label Studio.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","id":"c5c69abd-d960-42d6-ba72-0cba79615418","lists":[],"salaryRange":{"max":3.5,"currency":"USD","interval":"per-hour-wage","min":3.5},"text":"Project Cursa - Robot Manipulation Video Annotator","country":"PH","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"","openingPlain":"","descriptionBody":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">About the Role</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">We are looking for detail-oriented annotators to help label robot manipulation videos for AI training purposes.&nbsp;You'll&nbsp;watch short videos of robots performing manipulation tasks (filmed from three synchronized camera angles) and produce precise, structured, natural-language descriptions of the actions taking place. This work directly supports the development of robotics AI models and requires strong written English, sharp observational skills, and the discipline to follow a detailed style guide consistently.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">What You'll Do</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Watch short robot manipulation videos, each filmed from three synchronized camera views (an overhead view and views from each of the robot's two wrist-mounted cameras).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Break each video into time segments and write clear, natural-language descriptions for each segment.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Apply labels at three levels of detail for each applicable segment:&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"2\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Courier New\" data-leveltext=\"o\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Atomic motion</span></strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;(a few seconds) &mdash; a single small movement (e.g., \"close fingers around the red handle\")</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"2\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Courier New\" data-leveltext=\"o\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Skill / subtask</span></strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;(several seconds to ~20&nbsp;seconds) &mdash;&nbsp;a complete, meaningful action (e.g., \"pick up the red block by its edge\")</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"2\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Courier New\" data-leveltext=\"o\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Task / goal</span></strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;(up to ~1&nbsp;minute) &mdash;&nbsp;the overall purpose of a sequence of skills (e.g., \"place all blocks in the container\")</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Ensure every moment of video is covered by a label at two or more of these levels &mdash; no gaps, including idle or pause moments.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Accurately describe&nbsp;exactly what happens, including when something&nbsp;doesn't&nbsp;go as planned (a dropped object, a failed grasp, a slipped grip). Precision matters more than making the robot look successful.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Cross-reference&nbsp;all three camera angles: use the overhead view to understand the overall scene and object identity, and the close-up wrist views to confirm exact contact and grasp details.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Follow a detailed style guide covering vocabulary for actions, spatial relationships, object descriptions, and manner of movement, applying it consistently across many episodes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"1\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Participate in periodic calibration sessions to align your labeling with the team and the client's reference examples.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">What We're Looking For</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Required:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong written English &mdash;&nbsp;you'll&nbsp;write dozens of short, precise descriptive sentences per video and need to vary your language rather than repeating the same phrases.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Sharp attention to detail &mdash; able to distinguish&nbsp;small differences&nbsp;(a successful grasp vs. a fumble, a push vs. a drag, which specific object part is being touched).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Comfort following a detailed, structured style guide and applying it consistently, even in ambiguous or edge-case scenarios.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Basic comfort with spatial/mechanical description (left/right, above/below, naming object parts like handles, lids, or edges).</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Reliable, self-directed work&nbsp;habits &mdash; this is&nbsp;often heads-down work with periodic check-ins rather than close supervision.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Nice to Have:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"3\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Prior experience with video annotation, data labeling, transcription, or QA work.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"3\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Familiarity with robotics terminology (grippers, end-effectors, manipulation) &mdash; helpful but not necessary, as the style guide is self-contained.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"3\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience with annotation tools such as Label Studio.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"About the Role \nWe are looking for detail-oriented annotators to help label robot manipulation videos for AI training purposes. You'll watch short videos of robots performing manipulation tasks (filmed from three synchronized camera angles) and produce precise, structured, natural-language descriptions of the actions taking place. This work directly supports the development of robotics AI models and requires strong written English, sharp observational skills, and the discipline to follow a detailed style guide consistently. \nWhat You'll Do \nWatch short robot manipulation videos, each filmed from three synchronized camera views (an overhead view and views from each of the robot's two wrist-mounted cameras). \n\n\n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/weloglobal/c5c69abd-d960-42d6-ba72-0cba79615418","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/weloglobal/c5c69abd-d960-42d6-ba72-0cba79615418/apply"}